OL,3,ABrand's barrister refers himself to
OL,4,Aregulator after report he confronted
OL,5,Ajournalist
OL,6,
OL,7,F"Apparently I said, but I can't
OL,8,Factually remember this but I've read it
OL,9,Fin reporting, 'I am pleased that
OL,10,Fjustice has been done'", Urwin said.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/38
